OL,3,GNEWSAImpending closure of Post Office
OL,4,Adivides opinion
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents are divided over plans to
OL,7,Fclose the only Post Office in Crawley
OL,8,Ftown centre.
OL,10,FThe facility in the County Mall is
OL,11,Fexpected to shut early next year in
OL,12,Fline with the TJ Jones store on the
OL,13,Fsame site, which the retailer said
OL,14,Fwould close on 17 February.
OL,16,FA spokesperson for the Post Office said
OL,17,Fthey hoped to open a new branch "as
OL,18,Fsoon as possible", although this could
OL,19,Ftake "around six months".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
