OL,3,GNEWSAImpending closure of Post Office
OL,4,Adivides opinion
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeverley Friend said she was "not
OL,7,Fhappy" about the closure because there
OL,8,Fweren't many post offices in the area,
OL,9,Fwhile Olivia Colcheita said she had not
OL,10,Fused the post office in four years.
